UID:stanford_campus-localist-54125978092384-54125978094433@local-events
DESCRIPTION:How has Russia sustained its confrontation with the West since
  2022\, and at what cost? In her new book\, Hanna Notte argues the Kremlin
  is waging a war not only on Ukraine but over the global order itself.\n\n
 Notte traces how Russia adapted after the invasion. It worked around sanct
 ions\, built new partnerships\, cultivated support across the Global South
  and tried to deepen divisions within Western democracies. Her account com
 bines policy analysis with field reporting from more than a dozen countrie
 \n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://cddrl.fsi.stanford.edu/events/book-tal
